5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I worry that making the fee structure visible will break the quiet trust we have.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I need to know if the next treasurer will actually survive the workload.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am curious why the same dozen people do everything while others pay.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I notice people hesitating to commit to evenings. Why is that?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I refuse to guess the cost again. We need real numbers for next year.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, guessing is dangerous. If we get it wrong, people leave.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, I agree. But the workload is the real killer for staff.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, the workload is uneven. Who is actually doing the work?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, the hesitation is real. People feel they are being forced.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, I am not forcing anyone. I am trying to be fair.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will look at the taster forms to see why people drift away.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will check the treasurer's logged hours to see the true cost.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will tally the sign-in sheets to see who is actually here.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the winter social feedback to understand the hesitation.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will review the ledger to see where the money actually goes.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will also check the minute books from the named-grade years.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I will also look at the bank statements for renewal patterns.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will also check the rota against the attendance record.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I will also look at the weekday turnout since the summer outings.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I will also check the sign-up records for mid-year joiners.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
