33,2,,status,Jonathan,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The taster forms say people fear committing to a whole year at once.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,Chasing individual payments took six hours a month. A yearly collection took one.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,A quarter of members do two-thirds of the work. Eighteen never show up.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"When we charged per outing, weekday turnout dropped by a third and never recovered.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"Seventy percent of costs are fixed, like hall hire, whether anyone comes or not.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, if costs are fixed, a flat fee makes sense to cover them.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, but a flat fee means chasing the same people who don't pay.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, if we charge per event, the regulars will hate the extra hassle.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, the data says per-event charging kills the casuals. We need stability.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, stability is good, but we need to cover the fixed costs reliably.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,I think a flat fee protects the newcomers who are afraid of commitment.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I worry about the administrative burden, but the data supports a yearly collection.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I am concerned about the free-riders, but I don't want to punish the regulars.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"I agree with Asuka. The hesitation is about the unknown, not the cost.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"I am leaning towards a flat fee, but we need to set it high enough.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,A flat fee is the only way to keep the door open for drifters.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,I can manage the yearly collection if we stop chasing individual events.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will accept it if it stops the resentment from the heavy users.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Yes, let's stop the per-event anxiety. It is hurting the club.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Takumi,,Agreed. Let's look at the options.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
