73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I am voting for A. It removes the anxiety of per-event costs.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Takumi,,I am voting for A. It covers the fixed costs reliably.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
